<title>USA: Travelers Group unit to issue debt.</title>
<headline>Travelers Group unit to issue debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Travelers Group Inc unit, Smith Barney Holdings, is expected to tap the corporate bond market with a $250 million debt offering on its own behalf, dealers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The offering is expected to include a five-year maturity, they said.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the deal.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
